chapter.v:
	Over the 

	 first division for the first month was Jashobeam the son of Zabdiel, and in his division were twenty-four thousand;
 [1 Chr. 27:1-34]

	Furthermore, over 

	 the tribes of Israel: the officer over the Reubenites was Eliezer the son of Zichri; over the Simeonites, Shephatiah the son of Maachah;
 [1 Kin. 10:28; 22:36; 2 Chr. 9:28]
